Comment (internal/api/handler/workflows/import.go:42):
**Low — `omitempty` on a struct value is a no-op.**

`Summary workflowseed.SeedSummary `json:"summary,omitempty"`` — `omitempty` has no effect on a non-pointer struct, so an all-zeros `summary` object is always serialized in every `WorkflowImportFileResult`, including for failed files where it carries no information.

Suggestion: drop the `omitempty` (it's misleading), or make the field `*workflowseed.SeedSummary` so it can actually be omitted for failed files.
