Comment (internal/api/handler/workflows/import.go:78):
**Low — multipart temp files are never cleaned up.**

`ctx.MultipartForm()` parses the whole request; parts exceeding Echo's 32 MB in-memory threshold spill to temp files on disk. With up to `maxImportFiles` (10) × `maxImportFileBytes` (5 MiB) ≈ 50 MB, the overflow is written to `/tmp` and never removed — there's no `defer form.RemoveAll()`. It's bounded and admin-only, and it matches the pre-existing `filter_import.go` / `oscal/import.go` pattern, but since this endpoint deliberately adds resource bounds, cleanup fits the same intent.\n\nSuggestion: `defer func() { if form.File != nil { _ = form.RemoveAll() } }()` after a successful `ctx.MultipartForm()`.
